{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Even Though I'm a Super Timid Noble Girl, I Accepted the Bet From My Cunning Fiancé","I was reborn as a villainous daughter in a reverse harem otome game. \n\n\n\nAfter being sick with a high fever at the age of 10, Pia Rockwell suddenly remembered her past life as a university student in Japan. But far from going down the villainess route, all this super timid girl wants is to finally use her knowledge from when she was a grad student studying to get her doctorate in paleontology. Her ultimate goal is to become a commoner, excavate fossils, build a museum and then become a curator.\n\n\n\nSo in order to escape the villainess route and avoid being deported by her fiancé during the graduation ball, Pia decides to avoid the upcoming hurt and heartache and asks to break off her engagement to Rufus, the Prime Minister's son.\n\n\n\nBut will her cunning fiancé let her go that easily?"],"ja":["弱気MAX令嬢なのに、辣腕婚約者様の賭けに乗ってしまった",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-62753","ids":{"shikimori":62753,"mal":62753,"anilist":200455,"kodik":"serial-78497"},"kodikIds":["serial-78529","serial-78752","serial-78799","serial-78497"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-78529":"2026-11-01T16:20:52Z","serial-78752":"2026-10-26T15:17:30Z","serial-78799":"2026-10-09T17:59:43Z","serial-78497":"2026-11-01T15:18:40Z"},"title":"Несмотря на то, что я очень робкая благородная девушка, я приняла пари от своего хитрого жениха","originalTitle":"Yowaki Max Reijou na no ni, Ratsuwan Konyakusha-sama no Kake ni Notte Shimatta","alt":"Несмотря на то, что я очень робкая благородная девушка, я приняла пари от своего хитрого жениха / Even Though I'm a Super Timid Noble Girl, I Accepted the Bet From My Cunning Fiancé","description":"Однажды десятилетняя дворянка Пия Рокуэлл слегла с жаром и, пока находилась при смерти, вспомнила свою прошлую жизнь. Открытие оказалось горьким, ведь её жизнь студентки-палеонтолога не задалась. Кавалер жестоко бросил её, перед этим украв исследование. Мало того, она осознала, что оказалась не абы где, а внутри отомэ-игры — в роли злодейки-невесты одного из пяти возлюбленных главной героини. По сюжету её ждёт предательство жениха, разбитое сердце и изгнание из страны. Понимая, что вряд ли сможет противостоять очарованию главной героини, Пия немедля попросила своего жениха Руфуса Стэна разорвать помолвку и избавить её от страданий. Выслушав её доводы (а точнее, пересказ событий игры), Руфус ... предложил пари!","year":2026,"type":"TV","genres":["седзе","Романтика","исэкай","злодейка"],"rating":6.87,"popularity":0,"ongoing":true,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/62753/3a37aaf88d87e7fb2c0811d67dee8f11.jpeg","width":424,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/200455-rlIXyuk0jHE3.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-923","dubId":"923","label":"AnimeVost","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-78529","translationId":"923","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1674468/28d323e62a4cdcb1d65b930feaf58cac/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-3955","dubId":"3955","label":"AniTime Voice","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-78752","translationId":"3955","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1675834/bd8e48637550124378fcbc94fcafe65a/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-4138","dubId":"4138","label":"NDA Studio","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-78799","t